    //     and 0x38ee4 BYTE `strb w8,[x10,x11]` (0x382b6948). This logs every store whose target lands in
    //     [off-4, off+4) of bufbase=*(x20) (w11l88) -- i.e. overlapping buffer[off:+4] -- as
    //     {disp, site, off, ea, base, idx, val, size, pre(4B at ea before store)}, to NAME the writer of
    //     buffer[0x2080a:+4] (w11l118 family-B) and its VALUE + TIMING trajectory vs the device
    //     (device: 0x34b111be -> 0x0001d41d -> 0x00000000 -> 0x8c788a7a). Emulate the store + step (so the
    //     decode runs on). Co-arm MACAPK_TRACE_GUEST_LIB=libpairipcore.so TRACE_GUEST_OFFS=38e44,38ee4,556a0.
