                    // cont.257: track buffer[0x2080a:+4] (the pass-534 select idx0 read) per hub pass to
                    // find WHEN it diverges on our side. desc+0=bufbase (w12l4). Device keeps it at a value
                    // whose byte@0x2080a is 0x7e; ours reads 0x00 at pass 534. Log every CHANGE
