    // writes next-state 0xca1, the exit arm writes 0x47667. w20 is chosen by FNV-1-hash-membership csels
    // (+0x6a050/+0x6a128) comparing an FNV hash vs an expected value in [sp+0x1c0]. Log the continue/exit
