            // matter here are CYCLIC VM state (0x4b6f6 -> 0x00bc5 -> 0x205c0 -> 0x4b6f6), so
            // forcing them on every record corrupts the machine (measured: the run dies at
            // ~11k outer states instead of ~190k). Forcing them only at the transition that
            // READS the slot answers "how far do we get if this one read saw the device's
