// int normalizes to `true`. That is exactly how HCR 1.8.1 lost its locked-car
// UI: cocos2d-x's CCUserDefaultAndroid::getBoolForKey funnels through
// getIntegerForKey -> CallStaticIntMethodV into
// org.cocos2dx.lib.Cocos2dxUserDefault, so every "<car>_unlocked" query came
// back true, every car looked already owned, and the LOCKED overlay + COST
// label were skipped for all of them.
