// the guest arguments into a real jvalue[] with the ARM32-correct packer, then
// call the JVM's A form. pack_arm32_valist_into_jvalues is the AAPCS32 reader --
// on ARM32 a va_list is a SINGLE POINTER, not the AAPCS64 5-word struct that
// bionic_repack_args assumes for Stage-6 arm64 guests.
