            // runs at Android speed; every other mutex keeps the barging window the coroutine needs.
            // MACAPK_INPUT_FAIR_EXEMPT (see the block above macapk_xs_pump_thread): the thread
            // synchronously delivering a touch/key event to the guest skips the sleep too -- it is
            // not the starving-producer pattern this tax exists for, and it is the exact thread the
            // user is waiting on to see their tap register.
