    // (libc/bionic/pthread_cond.cpp) copies COND_CLOCK_MASK out of the attr the
    // same way and defaults to CLOCK_REALTIME when attr is NULL. We keep the
    // identical bit position; the guest never inspects a condattr_t, so only
    // our own setclock/init pair has to agree on it.
